# Version bumps

When this session makes shippable app changes (not docs/CI/skills-only), bump the marketing version once before finishing:

```bash
python3 scripts/bump-version.py patch
```

Use `minor` for new features, `major` only if the user asks. Follow `.cursor/skills/bump-app-version/SKILL.md`. Do not change iOS `CFBundleVersion` (CI owns build numbers).
